### 第 16 阶段：未携带管理密钥，预期 401
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/users/9800/orders
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-denied

### 携带正确管理密钥，预期正常返回
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/users/9800/orders
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-ok
X-Admin-Key: eventrush-admin-key

### 按订单查询电子票，也需要管理密钥
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/orders/replace-with-order-id/ticket
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-ticket
X-Admin-Key: eventrush-admin-key

### 按票码查询电子票，也需要管理密钥
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/tickets/replace-with-ticket-code
X-Trace-Id: trace-admin-ticket-code
X-Admin-Key: eventrush-admin-key
